   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 7. Mesh Quality Control\n",
    "\n",
    "### Circumcenter Distance Control for Delft3D FM\n",
    "\n",
    "For numerical models like **Delft3D FM**, it is essential to control the distance between circumcenters of adjacent triangles.\n",
    "Small flow links (circumcenters too close together) can cause numerical instabilities in hydrodynamic computations."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 14,
   "id": "reproject-viz",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 800x800 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# Reproject to geographic coordinates\n",
    "vert_geo = reproject_node(vert, get_local_utm_crs(crs, lon, lat), crs)\n",
    "vert_c_geo = reproject_node(vert_c, get_local_utm_crs(crs, lon, lat), crs)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Visualize in geographic coordinates\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(8, 8))\n",
    "\n",
    "ax.triplot(vert_geo[:, 0], vert_geo[:, 1], tria[:, 0:3], color='green', lw=1.5, label='Forcing mesh')\n",
    "ax.triplot(vert_c_geo[:, 0], vert_c_geo[:, 1], tria_c[:, 0:3], color='steelblue', lw=0.5, label='Computational mesh')\n",
    "\n",
    "ax.set_xlabel('Longitude (deg)')\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel('Latitude (deg)')\n",
    "ax.set_title('Nested Mesh System (Geographic coordinates)')\n",
    "ax.legend()\n",
    "ax.axis('equal');"
   ]
  },
